{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Arithmetic Calculators 是一款以長算法示範加、減、乘、除步驟的學習工具，適合學生及需要鞏固基礎運算能力的人士使用。它原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，可協助使用者在沒有計算機時理解並掌握基本算術。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-135.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>長算術步驟清晰示範</h2>\n<p>Arithmetic Calculators 會示範加法、減法、乘法和除法的長算步驟，讓使用者理解如何以長算法解題，而非只依賴計算機。應用程式操作快速直觀，並且可獨立運作，在互聯網連接欠佳或沒有網絡的地方也能使用，適合用來打好數學基礎。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-55-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-56-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-57-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-58-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-59-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-60-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Arithmetic Calculators</li><li>應用類別：Education</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/arithmetic-calculators/id6470699979?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:35.967445+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":301,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T09:30:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.085640+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:27.923902+00:00","content_hash":"d58fe9937e9a6c30a628482e40f494ecb6a6b3da8f7c8acc8aba6b6d6ecc8288","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:35.967445+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}